<td colspan="2">Mathildelaan 1<span style="float:right"><span class="mw-valign-text-top" typeof="mw:File/Frameless" data-mw='{"caption":"Bewerken op Wikidata"}'><a href="https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q2325075?uselang=nl#P6375" title="Bewerken op Wikidata"><img resource="https://nl.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bestand:OOjs_UI_icon_edit-ltr-progressive.svg" src="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/8a/OOjs_UI_icon_edit-ltr-progressive.svg/20px-OOjs_UI_icon_edit-ltr-progressive.svg.png?utm_source=nl.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail" decoding="async" loading="lazy" alt="Bewerken op Wikidata" data-file-width="20" data-file-height="20" data-file-type="drawing" height="10" width="10" class="mw-file-element"/></a></span></span></td></tr>
